        "Id": "ec205a8ba8d401f618420711eb81d340",
        "Title": "Describe the field",
        "DescriptionText": "A switch. onText and offText name the two states, which is worth doing whenever \"on\" and \"off\" are less clear than the words the job actually uses.",
